# Graphify scope: source code only (gitignore syntax; read by every build, `graphify update` and the git hooks).
#
# Documents, PDFs and images are sent to an LLM for extraction, and this repo's architecture spec, design brief and
# audit screenshots are confidential. So everything is ignored except the six source folders, and anything that is
# not code is ignored even inside them.

# 1. Ignore everything at the top level...
/*
# ...except the source folders.
!/app/
!/lib/
!/components/
!/supabase/
!/tests/
!/scripts/

# 2. Never, wherever it sits: documents, specs, papers, images, media, office files, secrets, backups.
*.md
*.mdx
*.txt
*.rst
*.html
*.yaml
*.yml
*.pdf
*.png
*.jpg
*.jpeg
*.gif
*.webp
*.svg
*.ico
*.mp4
*.mov
*.webm
*.mp3
*.wav
*.docx
*.xlsx
*.pptx
*.csv
.env*
*.pem
*.bak

# 3. Generated or local-only folders inside the source tree.
supabase/.temp/
**/__snapshots__/
**/*-snapshots/
